1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,710
(Sheldon:)I know,
that's why I shortened it.

2
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,240
What do you want?

3
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:08,950
(Sheldon:)I came to go over your alibi
for last night.

4
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,380
(Leonard:)What alibi?

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,320
(Sheldon:)You've asked me

6
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,650
(Sheldon:)to lie on your behalf,
and as you know,

7
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:16,650
(Sheldon:)I am deeply uncomfortable
with impromptu dishonesty,

8
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,790
(Sheldon:)so I've provided you

9
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:19,990
with an ironclad alibi.

10
00:00:19,990 --> 00:00:22,660
(Sheldon:)You couldn't have spent
last night with Priya

11
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,730
(Sheldon:)because you were
with another woman.

12
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:26,960
(Leonard:)Oh, I'm so sure
I'm gonna regret this,

13
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:30,070
(Leonard:)but who was I with?

14
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:34,170
The fun-loving and morally loose
Miss Maggie McGarry.

15
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,610
(Leonard:)Oh, God.

16
00:00:35,610 --> 00:00:38,710
(Sheldon:)You met her at Pasadena's most
popular Irish watering hole,

17
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:42,150
(Sheldon:)Lucky Baldwin's, where Maggie
spends her nights tending bar

18
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:45,350
(Sheldon:)with a head full of curls
and a heart full of dreams.

19
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:49,450
"Leonard, call me if you
are interested in coitus.

20
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,090
(Leonard(reading a napkin Sheldon has handed him):)Sincerely,
Maggie McGarry."

21
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:54,380
(Sheldon:)And if anyone were

22
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:59,300
(Sheldon:)to actually call that number,
they will hear this.

